      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    S = 150.0\n    K = 140.0\n    r = 0.02\n    T = 0.5\n    volatility = 0.25\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    from math import erf, exp, log, sqrt\n\n    def norm_cdf(x):\n        return 0.5 * (1.0 + erf(x / sqrt(2.0)))\n\n    d1 = (log(S / K) + (r + 0.5 * volatility ** 2) * T) / (\n        volatility * sqrt(T)\n    )\n    d2 = d1 - volatility * sqrt(T)\n\n    put_price = K * exp(-r * T) * norm_cdf(-d2) - S * norm_cdf(-d1)\n\n    # Return the fair price rounded to two decimal places\n    return round(put_price, 2)\n```",
